+## Immutable Semantics
+
+The following source sentence is copied from the live R-00299 requirement and is the authority for the grouped list that follows:
+
+> GAS 是会计而非第二仓库；状态住 ECS，Modifier ledger 是 Effect 条目的推导视图。C# Runtime 负责有状态编排与真值，Rust NativeCore 只做无状态计算/调度。四个 ECS 组件为 Ability/Effect/Attribute/Tag，`fx_key` 在 Effect 条目上且无 FxComponent。Ability 八态、Effect 六态、五步准入、Commit 只复查冷却和消耗、帧计数时间、Tag 计数层级匹配、双哈希域、预测键=帧号、整帧回滚、`GasAndEventFinalize` 唯一提交点及所有“不做”项必须逐条引用。
+
+These are fifteen grouped constraints, not new decisions:
